Prior reverse-engineering research
----------------------------------

NOOP credits the following community interoperability projects. Source comparison
confirms that some implementations were inherited, rather than facts-only.

  johnmiddleton12/wearable (formerly my-whoop)
    https://github.com/johnmiddleton12/wearable
    WHOOP 4.0 BLE protocol, Swift packages and collection work, as credited in
    ATTRIBUTION.md.

  b-nnett/goose — https://github.com/b-nnett/goose
    WHOOP 5.0 / MG ("puffin") BLE protocol facts.

Source comparison confirms my-whoop implementation lineage through ryanbr/noop,
including identical current Schema.swift, Values.swift and Cursors.swift blobs.
